I'll create a faithful reproduction of the 1978 Taito arcade classic "Asteroids" (often confused with the earlier "Space Invaders" from 1978) as a single self-contained HTML file. This will replicate the original arcade experience with vector-style graphics, authentic scoring, and gameplay mechanics.

